# Section responsive (every section)

**Every** new or edited section must work on **every** screen. No exceptions.

## Breakpoints (verify each)

| Label | Width |
|-------|-------|
| Phone SE | 320 |
| Mobile | 390 |
| Tablet | 768 |
| Laptop | 1024 |
| Desktop | 1280+ |

## Must

1. Mobile-first Tailwind: base → `sm:` → `md:` → `lg:` → `xl:`
2. Shells: `min-w-0`, `max-w-full`, `overflow-x-clip`
3. Grids collapse: 3-col → 1-col on phone; 2-col OK at `sm`/`md`
4. CTAs: `w-full` on phone, `sm:w-auto` when designed
5. Sticky side copy only from `lg:` up
6. Decorative absolute text (vertical words) hide below `xl:` if they cause overflow

## Never

- Ship desktop-only then shrink later
- Horizontal page scroll
- Absolute UI that covers CTAs on small screens

## Done check

Before done: mentally (or browser) pass 320 / 390 / 768 / 1024 / 1280 for **that section**.
